1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,220
You can now rent living

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,230
human brain cells

3
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:02,920
to run your code.

4
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,670
A company called

5
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,310
