21
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,280
So instead of renting

22
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:19,570
compute

23
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:20,470
from a traditional cloud

24
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:21,250
provider, you're

25
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:21,940
effectively renting

26
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,780
access to a living

27
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,510
neural network

28
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:24,670
that can adapt and learn

29
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,520
from feedback.

30
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,490
That matters because

31
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:27,340
modern AI has a huge

32
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,320
