52
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,040
AI infrastructure.

53
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:44,900
We've spent decades

54
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,990
trying to make computers

55
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:47,240
